ities, leading to the mobilization of the peoples of Kohistan and Logar on the Sunni side, and some 10,000 Hazaras from Hazarajat on the side of the Shi’as. Thus, Shah Mahmud’s first reign ended as a result of this unprecedented Shi’a-Sunni conflict in Kabul.” ”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 899, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 805})
