rious inanimate objects, such as trees or rocks, are believed to have spirits, and offerings are regularly made to them. ” <br>“Most Miao have a pervasive belief in spirits or genies.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 878, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 736})
