nd harmonious relationship, because religions need each other. Syncretism did not only happen between these two religions but also with the folk religions knows as animism and dynamism. Syncretism took place smoothly because there were similarities between the three belief systems, both in the structure and the principles: the existence of a Super Being having a particular position; the existence of worship and sacrifice as well as rites, magic, magical authority, mythology, and other rituality. This situation was conducive to the creation of an attitude of give and take among the co-existing religions, as a necessity of survival.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 951, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 749})
