rmanent foothold, the hinterlands continued to enjoy considerable autonomy. In both areas, the Indigenous chiefly structure managed to persist intact, even in the towns were liked to Spanish administrative oversight.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 842, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 736})
